§ `s 6A -- periods in months (the Act's own note: 30 September plus 3 months is 30 December)`

#ASSERT `the day a period of months ends` 20310930 3 EQUALS 20311230
#ASSERT `the day a period of months ends` 20310901 120 EQUALS 20410901

§ `ss 6, 17 -- what a trade mark is (d046)`

#ASSERT `Is my sign a trade mark` `the word JARRAH for legal software (d046)`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my sign a trade mark` `something that is not a sign`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my sign a trade mark` `a sign kept only as decoration`

§ `s 27 -- who may apply (d046)`

#ASSERT `May I apply` `Jarrah Legal Technologies Pty Ltd (d046)`
#ASSERT NOT `May I apply` `an unincorporated name with no legal personality`

§ `s 41 -- capable of distinguishing`

#ASSERT `Is my mark capable of distinguishing` `the word JARRAH for legal software (d046)`
